          "id": "Proposition No. 1",
          "title": "Mount Vernon Transportation Benefit District: Renewal of Sales and Use Tax for Transportation Improvements",
          "summary": "The City of Mount Vernon, acting as the Mount Vernon Transportation Benefit District, asks voters to renew its sales and use tax of two-tenths of one percent (0.2%) for ten more years under Resolution No. 1097. The tax, first approved in 2016, would otherwise end in April 2027. Revenue may be used only for transportation improvements, maintenance and repair in the City identified in the resolution; the explanatory statement estimates about $2.3 million per year.",
